---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="Privacy Policy for ToolkitFree - Learn how we handle your data."
  canonical="https://toolkitfree.net/privacy-policy/"
>
  <article class="legal-page">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="last-updated">Last updated: August 1, 2026</p>

    <h2>Overview</h2>
    <p>
      ToolkitFree ("we", "us", "our") provides free browser-based tools for images, PDFs, QR codes,
      ID photos, and animated media. This Privacy Policy explains how information is handled when
      you use toolkitfree.net.
    </p>

    <h2>Local File Processing</h2>
    <p>
      Files selected for conversion, editing, or export are processed locally in your browser using
      client-side JavaScript, Canvas, WebAssembly, or browser APIs. ToolkitFree does not upload
      those files to a processing server or store copies of the processed files.
    </p>
    <p>
      The website still uses network requests to load site resources. Background removal downloads a
      browser model and runtime, and the animation converter downloads a site-hosted FFmpeg runtime
      when needed. ToolkitFree does not currently load advertising scripts.
    </p>

    <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
    <h3>Automatically Collected Information</h3>
    <p>When you visit our website, we may automatically collect:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Browser type and version</li>
      <li>Operating system</li>
      <li>Pages visited and time spent on pages</li>
      <li>Referring website</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>Cookies and Similar Technologies</h3>
    <p>ToolkitFree does not currently use advertising cookies. Website infrastructure may use:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <strong>Essential storage or cookies:</strong> Used only when required for website delivery, security,
        or browser functionality.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Traffic measurement:</strong> Cloudflare Web Analytics may collect aggregate website usage
        information; it does not receive files selected for processing.
      </li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Third-Party Services</h2>
    <p>We may use third-party services that collect information about you, including:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Cloudflare — for hosting, CDN, security, and Web Analytics</li>
      <li>Google Search Console — for aggregate search-performance reporting</li>
    </ul>
    <p>These services have their own privacy policies governing the use of your information.</p>

    <h2>Data Security</h2>
    <p>
      We take reasonable measures to protect your information. However, no method of transmission
      over the Internet is 100% secure, and we cannot guarantee absolute security.
    </p>

    <h2>Children's Privacy</h2>
    <p>
      Our website is not directed to children under 13. We do not knowingly collect personal
      information from children under 13.
    </p>

    <h2>Changes to This Policy</h2>
    <p>
      We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. We will notify you of any changes by
      posting the new Privacy Policy on this page and updating the "Last updated" date.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact Us</h2>
    <p>
      If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy, please contact us at <a
        href="mailto:hnhw182@gmail.com">hnhw182@gmail.com</a
      > or visit our <a href="/contact/">Contact</a> page.
    </p>
  </article>
</Layout>
